@startuml UML_P3_Ranked_Matchmaking_Sequence

title Sequence Diagram - Ranked Matchmaking

actor "User A" as UserA
participant "RankedPage" as Page
participant "MatchmakingService" as MM
participant "WebSocket" as WS
participant "MatchmakingEngine" as Engine
participant "API" as API
database "DB" as DB
actor "User B" as UserB

== Join Queue ==

UserA -> Page: Nhấn "Tìm trận Ranked"
activate Page

Page -> MM: joinRankedQueue(userId, rating)
activate MM

MM -> API: POST /api/ranked/queue
activate API

API -> DB: INSERT INTO queue\n(userId, rating, timestamp)
activate DB
DB --> API: OK
deactivate DB

API --> MM: {queueId, position}
deactivate API

MM -> WS: subscribeToMatchmaking(queueId)
activate WS

WS --> MM: WebSocket connected
MM --> Page: Queue joined\n(position: #15)
Page --> UserA: Hiển thị "Đang tìm đối thủ..."
deactivate MM

...Người chơi B cũng join queue...

UserB -> Page: Join queue
Page -> MM: joinRankedQueue()
MM -> API: POST /api/ranked/queue
API -> DB: INSERT INTO queue
DB --> API: OK
API --> MM: OK

== Matchmaking Process ==

Engine -> DB: SELECT * FROM queue\nWHERE status = 'waiting'\nORDER BY timestamp
activate Engine
activate DB

DB --> Engine: List of waiting users
deactivate DB

Engine -> Engine: Tìm cặp phù hợp\n(rating ±100 Elo)

alt Tìm thấy cặp phù hợp
    
    Engine -> API: POST /api/ranked/match/create
    activate API
    
    API -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    activate DB
    
    API -> DB: INSERT INTO matches\n(player1_id, player2_id,\nmode='ranked', status='matched')
    DB --> API: matchId
    
    API -> DB: UPDATE queue\nSET status='matched'\nWHERE userId IN (userA, userB)
    DB --> API: OK
    
    API -> DB: COMMIT
    deactivate DB
    
    API --> Engine: {matchId, players}
    deactivate API
    
    == Notify Players ==
    
    Engine -> WS: emitMatchFound(matchId)
    
    WS --> UserA: Match found!\n{matchId, opponent: UserB}
    WS --> UserB: Match found!\n{matchId, opponent: UserA}
    deactivate WS
    
    UserA -> Page: Nhận thông báo
    Page -> MM: acceptMatch(matchId)
    activate MM
    
    MM -> API: POST /api/ranked/match/{matchId}/accept
    activate API
    
    API -> DB: UPDATE match_participants\nSET accepted=true\nWHERE matchId AND userId
    activate DB
    DB --> API: OK
    deactivate DB
    
    API --> MM: Accepted
    deactivate API
    MM --> Page: Chuyển đến GameBoard
    deactivate MM
    
    Page --> UserA: Hiển thị bàn cờ
    deactivate Page
    
else Không tìm thấy (timeout)
    
    Engine -> WS: emitQueueTimeout(userId)
    WS --> UserA: No match found
    WS --> Page: Timeout notification
    Page --> UserA: "Không tìm thấy đối thủ.\nThử lại?"
    
end

deactivate Engine

note over Engine
  Matchmaking chạy định kỳ
  mỗi 3-5 giây hoặc sử dụng
  event-driven architecture
  khi có user mới join
end note

note over WS
  WebSocket đảm bảo
  real-time notification
  cho cả 2 người chơi
end note

@enduml
